      <li>Click <em>4.5 t slab, up</em> and drag the instant \(t\) through the lift. The cable’s work climbs steadily, while the motion bar is a few hundred joules at full speed and gone again at the end. The lift costs 883 kJ whatever you do with \(t\).</li>
